<title>USA: GPU 850 MW Penn. coal unit shut due to leak.</title>
<headline>GPU 850 MW Penn. coal unit shut due to leak.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPU Generation Inc's 850 megawatt (MW) Keystone 2 coal-fired unit near Johnstown, Pa., was shut early Thursday due to a tube leak, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;There's a tube leak. It was discovered at 0234 EDT (Thursday),&quot; company spokeswoman Jane Oleksak said today, adding there was no restart time scheduled yet.</p>
</text>
